{
  "chapter_id": "110",
  "items": [
    {
      "text": "बातचीत के लिए",
      "source_page": 5,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:5",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "पाठ से",
      "source_page": 5,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:5",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "2. स्तंभ ‘क’ और स्तंभ ‘ख’ में आपस में सबं ंध रखने वाले शब्दों व कथनों का मिलान",
      "source_page": 6,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:6",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "सोचिए और लिखिए",
      "source_page": 7,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:7",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "1. कहानी में आए कुछ सज्ं ञा, सर्वनाम, विशेषण तथा क्रिया शब्द नीचे शब्द सरोवर",
      "source_page": 7,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:7",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "लिखिए —",
      "source_page": 7,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:7",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "शब्द सरोवर",
      "source_page": 7,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:7",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "2. कहानी में आए एकवचन और बहुवचन शब्दों की खोज करते हुए निम्न तालिका",
      "source_page": 8,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:8",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "एकवचन शब्द बहुवचन शब्द",
      "source_page": 8,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:8",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "3. नीचे दिए गए उपयुक् त शब्दों से रिक्‍त स्थानों की पूर्ति कीजिए —",
      "source_page": 8,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:8",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "वाक्यों को पुनः अपनी लेखन-पुस्तिका में लिखिए —",
      "source_page": 9,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:9",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "ु का में लिखिए।",
      "source_page": 10,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:10",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "विद्यालय के पुस्तकालय में जाकर कहानी में आए निम्नलिखित शब्दों के अर्थ",
      "source_page": 11,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:11",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "शब्दकोश की सहायता से लिखिए —",
      "source_page": 11,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:11",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "शब्द : गाढ़ी",
      "source_page": 11,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:11",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "शब्द : विनाेद",
      "source_page": 11,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:11",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "शब्द : तीक्ष्‍ण",
      "source_page": 11,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:11",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "शब्द : चितं न",
      "source_page": 11,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:11",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "शब्द : विश्राम",
      "source_page": 11,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:11",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "शब्द : श्रम",
      "source_page": 11,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:11",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "को अपने शब्दों में कविता या कहानी के रूप में",
      "source_page": 12,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:12",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    },
    {
      "text": "लिखिए। इस गतिविधि में आप अपने शिक्षक या",
      "source_page": 12,
      "source_ref": "ehve110.pdf:page:12",
      "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED"
    }
  ],
  "status": "SOURCE_DERIVED",
